==Trivia==
* Magoichi is the only Warlord with a completely unique transformation requirement. All other Warlords share some aspect of the requirement with another.

===Historical origin===
Magoichi is based on the real-life {{wp|Saika Magoichi}} of Japanese history, although the name itself is a moniker for at least three individuals, all whom were leaders of the {{wp|Saika Ikki}}. His relationship to [[Masamune]] in Conquest may suggest that he is based on Suzuki Shigetomo specifically.

His Flying type specialty in Conquest may reference his service under [[Masamune]].

